{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35867","headline":"和友人喜相遇十首 五 · 李咸用","name":"和友人喜相遇十首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲吟闲坐道相应，远想南华亦自矜。\n抛掷家乡轻似梦，寻常心地冷於僧。\n和羹使用非胥靡，忆鱠言词小季鹰。\n唯仗十篇金玉韵，此中高旨莫阶升。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35867.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35867","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}